{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\nこんばちは\nリハーサル期間中はドリームボックスなるものがありましてその中には沢山のお菓子が入っています🍿一口サイズのものだけどチリも積もればマウンテン、、、手が止まらず、、このままでは危険です。誰か止めて下さーい\n佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売の「ヤングガンガン」さんW佐々木で表紙やらせていただいております！\n撮影中もずっとみーぱんとお話ししてました🌛楽しかったオフショット〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7CH0PTCH4ZFT84QQXDH4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7DMG2YMVG7KEXD8D5G3T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7EPTT3E7BDH5GE9Q5ZNN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7FQ4VBRC3ANB9C2M81V7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7GSKARV7BD295EBN2TS3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7HT7WRGP520J09S27WRH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n少年誌の表紙初めてです！ありがたいです〜是非に🐶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、先月号のRayの記事も公開中ですので読んでください🌷https://twitter.com/mag_ray/status/1503681194902589441?s=21"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7JV9YQHJ22ED6CFA7RXT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7KV7PXYHWKG5XAMC0ZTX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7MX26MZCDMYYBQKCQ8JZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7NZ91C3518C7FPD3FX4M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n毎日レッスン着だけどなに着よう〜って考えるのが楽しい🫶#くみるっく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3X7PYGR5HSMRQD5P14MABK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">3本線おんな🪐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n